    "description": "<p><strong>Ongoing.</strong> Name one specific source of harm, such as burning, cutting, lightning, poisonous gas, or mundane projectiles; for as long as this Spell is Ongoing, you are immune to harm from that source (as well as any secondary effects; choking smoke, hypothermia, etc.).<br><br><em>Risk:</em> You gain +2 Armor against it but are not immune.<br><em>Greater:</em> Nearby allies are equally protected.</p>",
